# 2026-11-10 bug run: the user's intake had boundaries named Outlet2, Outlet_3, Outlet_4 left Walls (prism layers grown over
# three outlets, one way out). Boundaries says when names and kinds disagree and sets them from the names in one click;
# a name only containing the word ("pinlet") says nothing.
shell python3 "$QC_TESTS/tools/gen_named_box.py" $SB/ws/box.stl
open $SB/ws/cavity
click nav:mesh
wait-until page Mesh
click text:STL mesher
wait 5
click stl-path
enter $SB/ws/box.stl
wait 10
click stl-next
wait 3
click stl-next
wait 5
assert text Names and kinds disagree
assert text Inlet (Wall)
assert text Outlet_2 (Wall)
assert not text pinlet (Wall)
click stl-name-kinds
wait 5
assert not text Names and kinds disagree
shell grep -E '^boundary[0-9]+ = ' mesher/mesher.ini > $OUT/kinds.txt
assert log mesher/mesher.ini Inlet Inlet
assert log mesher/mesher.ini Outlet_2 Outlet
assert log mesher/mesher.ini outlet1 Outlet
assert log mesher/mesher.ini pinlet Wall
screenshot $OUT/1.png
